            "review_title": "Review at SayBar - Rooftop Dining",
            "review_text": "hoàng l\nDa Nang, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nThe Best Rooftop View in Da Nang\nAug 2026 • Family\nPerched high above the city, Say Bar Rooftop Dining offers a breathtaking experience where refined dining meets panoramic views. As the sun sets, the sky transforms into a stunning canvas of golden and crimson hues, while the city lights gradually come alive below. With elegant surroundings, refreshing cocktails, delicious cuisine, and a relaxing rooftop atmosphere, Say Bar is the perfect place to unwind, enjoy a romantic evening, and create unforgettable moments above the city and thank all stars for your amazing service\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 3, 2026",
