            "review_text": "Kiều T\n6 contributions\n0\nHIGHLY RECOMMEND\nAug 2026 • Friends\nI was so surprising with this new hidden spot located right closed in Dragon Bridge. The view from this bar was really making me wow even when sunset time or nighttime.\nI reserved the table in advanced, so I got a table with directly view at Dragon Fire show. Fantastic!!!!!\nI also request them to set up Birthday for me and they did, thank for that my special occasion was more memorable <3\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 2, 2026",
