            "review_title": "Review at SayBar - Rooftop Dining",
            "review_text": "Nguyệt N\n2 contributions\n0\nA Wonderful Evening at SAY Bar – Caro Premium Da Nang\nAug 2026 • Family\nI had a wonderful experience at SAY Bar at Caro Premium Da Nang. The bar has a stylish and modern atmosphere, making it a great place to relax and enjoy a drink after a long day of exploring the city.\n\nThe cocktails were beautifully presented and tasted excellent, and the service was friendly, attentive, and professional. I especially enjoyed the relaxing ambiance and the comfortable setting, which made the evening feel truly special.\n\nOverall, SAY Bar is definitely worth visiting if you are staying at Caro Premium Da Nang or looking for a nice place to unwind in the city. I would happily come back again!\nRead more\nWritten September 1, 2026",
