            "review_text": "HenryLe\nDa Nang, Vietnam26 contributions\n0\nThe best rooftop bar with breathtaking views of the Han River\nAug 2026 • Couples\nWe had a wonderful experience at Say Bar Rooftop Dining, and it was the perfect place to celebrate my wife’s birthday in Da Nang.\n\nFirst of all, the food was delicious. Every dish we ordered was well prepared, beautifully presented, and full of flavor. The drinks were also great and made the evening even more enjoyable.\n\nBut what really made our night special was the view. Sitting on the rooftop, overlooking the Han River and Dragon Bridge, was absolutely amazing. We were lucky enough to enjoy the Dragon Bridge show right from our table without having to deal with the crowds below. The atmosphere was relaxing, elegant, and perfect for a special occasion.\n\nA big thank you to the entire Say Bar team for helping us set up such a lovely birthday surprise for my wife. From the table decoration to the thoughtful service, everything was arranged with great care and attention to detail. The team was friendly, professional, and always ready to help.\n\nIt was a memorable evening for both of us, and my wife was truly happy with the surprise.\n\nHighly recommended if you’re looking for great food, beautiful views, and a special place to celebrate in Da Nang. We’ll definitely be coming back!\nRead more\nWritten September 1, 2026",
